{"v":1,"book":"Amos","ch":8,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Thus the Lord Jehovah showed me, and there was a basket of summer fruit.","tok":[{"t":"Thus the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Jehovah showed me, and there was a "},{"t":"basket","s":["H3619"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of summer "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H7019"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And He said, What do you see, Amos? And I said, A basket of summer fruit. Then Jehovah said to me, The end has come upon My people Israel; I will not pass them by anymore.","tok":[{"t":"And He "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", What do you see, "},{"t":"Amos","s":["H5986"],"a":[4]},{"t":"? And "},{"t":"I","s":["H7200"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[5]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"basket","s":["H3619"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of summer "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H7019"],"a":[7]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Then","s":["H0559"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"me","s":["H3068"],"a":[9]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"end","s":["H7093"],"a":[12]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[11]},{"t":" upon My "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[15]},{"t":"; I will not "},{"t":"pass","s":["H5674"],"a":[19]},{"t":" them by anymore."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And the songs of the temple will be wailings In that day, declares the Lord Jehovah. The corpses will be many; In every place They will cast them. Hush!","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"songs","s":["H7892"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"temple","s":["H1964"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will be wailings In that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"declares","s":["H5002"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[6]},{"t":" Jehovah. The corpses will be "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; In "},{"t":"every","s":["H6297"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[11]},{"t":" They will cast them. Hush!"}]},{"n":4,"text":"Hear t